1
00:02:26,739 --> 00:02:28,459
You went to work with your mom, sweetheart?

2
00:02:30,259 --> 00:02:31,339
Oh.

3
00:02:32,339 --> 00:02:33,339
Yes.

4
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:37,819
Is something wrong?

5
00:02:39,779 --> 00:02:40,620
Dad.

6
00:02:40,779 --> 00:02:43,298
Kao was wondering
if Kao could come stay home for a while.

7
00:02:43,299 --> 00:02:44,339
Is that okay?

8
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:47,940
This will always be your home, sweetheart.

9
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:57,299
What happened, sweetheart?

10
00:02:58,339 --> 00:03:00,060
It’s nothing much, Mom.

11
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:02,780
You know you’re doing the right thing, right?

12
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:04,259
- Huh?
- Mm.

13
00:03:04,739 --> 00:03:07,178
When you fight with your husband,

14
00:03:07,179 --> 00:03:09,739
you pack your things
and come sleep at your parents’ house.

15
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:12,460
Then your husband comes
after you and makes it up to you.

16
00:03:12,940 --> 00:03:14,819
Yeah, Happens to Dad all the time.

17
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:21,419
Where did Kao go?

18
00:03:21,420 --> 00:03:22,540
Mm, yeah Where is she?

19
00:03:22,699 --> 00:03:23,876
We can’t get hold of her at all.

20
00:03:23,900 --> 00:03:25,540
Could it be because of last night?

21
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:28,980
I’m really sorry.

22
00:03:30,859 --> 00:03:31,940
It’s okay.

23
00:03:33,859 --> 00:03:35,659
You guys go ahead and practice first.

24
00:03:37,980 --> 00:03:39,140
Tep G

25
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:40,940
quit.

26
00:03:41,819 --> 00:03:42,620
What?

27
00:03:42,779 --> 00:03:44,779
Kao texted. Kao texted, guys.

28
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:01,819
Guys.

29
00:04:02,299 --> 00:04:04,060
I’m sorry.

30
00:04:05,540 --> 00:04:06,739
I think.

31
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:10,299
I probably can’t compete in
the Pro League with you guys anymore.

32
00:04:14,259 --> 00:04:15,819
I’m quitting the team.

33
00:04:17,699 --> 00:04:18,900
If I keep competing.

34
00:04:19,699 --> 00:04:21,900
I’ll probably just hold you guys back.

35
00:04:24,659 --> 00:04:26,219
But I know

36
00:04:27,179 --> 00:04:28,980
you guys can do it.

37
00:04:29,379 --> 00:04:31,060
You guys are seriously so good.

38
00:04:33,779 --> 00:04:35,460
I love you guys.

39
00:04:37,339 --> 00:04:39,900
You’re the best team I could’ve asked for.

40
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:46,020
I promise.

41
00:04:46,699 --> 00:04:48,540
I’ll be there cheering for you every round.

42
00:04:53,259 --> 00:04:54,259
What do we do?

43
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,979
For everyone who’s been wondering

44
00:04:56,980 --> 00:05:00,420
who our famous gamer really is...

45
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:02,219
Once I tell you

46
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:04,339
don’t tell anyone, okay? Keep it to yourself.

47
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,699
Don’t tell anyone.

48
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:07,020
Is it Tep G?

49
00:05:07,021 --> 00:05:08,516
- Don’t say I’m gossiping now.
- Whoa, a pro player.

50
00:05:08,540 --> 00:05:11,420
It turns out Ithey’re actually a Thai etiquette teacher.

51
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,738
A Thai teacher.

52
00:05:12,739 --> 00:05:15,699
What I know is
someone sent in a photo, and.

53
00:05:15,859 --> 00:05:16,859
Ooh.

54
00:05:17,379 --> 00:05:18,379
Beautiful.

55
00:05:18,940 --> 00:05:20,219
No need to hide it.

56
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:21,780
You’re gonna blow up either way

57
00:05:22,020 --> 00:05:23,500
I think this is bad.

58
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,420
P’Kao’s face is all over the internet.

59
00:05:26,819 --> 00:05:28,258
How the hell did this happen?

60
00:05:28,259 --> 00:05:29,980
Who the hell exposed Kao?

61
00:05:30,140 --> 00:05:31,939
And Kao’s damn phone is off too.

62
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:33,420
It keeps going straight to voicemail.

63
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:37,500
Here, take it back.

64
00:05:37,659 --> 00:05:38,739
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

65
00:05:39,179 --> 00:05:40,859
Teach Kao is Tep G?

66
00:05:57,179 --> 00:05:58,179
Sis.

67
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:04,179
Don’t you think Professor Methat’s acting weirdly hyped?

68
00:06:12,420 --> 00:06:14,100
Practice.

69
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:16,140
Let’s practice.

70
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:21,540
What the hell are you doing, Kao?

71
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:25,980
I told you, didn’t I?
Whatever you do, think of me first.

72
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:29,779
How old are you now, Kao?

73
00:06:32,739 --> 00:06:34,179
What about me, Mom?

74
00:06:36,100 --> 00:06:38,620
Have you ever thought about how I feel?

75
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:41,779
Have you ever asked me

76
00:06:42,659 --> 00:06:44,259
what I want to do?

77
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:46,539
What I want to be?

78
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:47,859
And what about Rapee?

79
00:06:48,140 --> 00:06:49,698
Does he know about this?

80
00:06:49,699 --> 00:06:51,540
Will he be able to accept it?

81
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:01,179
Kao gave up her own dream

82
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:04,859
to become principal of this school,
just like Mom wanted.

83
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:08,699
I’ve already done this much.

84
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:12,140
And you’re still asking about someone else’s feelings?

85
00:07:12,540 --> 00:07:16,659
You’re still asking
whether P’Pee can accept it, Mom?

86
00:07:25,299 --> 00:07:26,460
Fine.

87
00:07:27,739 --> 00:07:29,379
Because now I know.

88
00:07:31,900 --> 00:07:35,060
Kao can’t
keep living out anyone else’s dream anymore.

89
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:41,060
Not even Kao’s own.

90
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,940
As for the principal position,

91
00:07:54,699 --> 00:07:56,580
Mom can start looking for someone else.

92
00:08:03,060 --> 00:08:04,299
I quit.

93
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:10,500
Oh.

94
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:14,859
And about P’Pee.

95
00:08:17,179 --> 00:08:18,739
Mom, you don’t need to worry.

96
00:09:33,419 --> 00:09:34,578
Mr. Rapee?

97
00:09:34,579 --> 00:09:35,820
Noi, I’m not hungry yet.

98
00:09:36,219 --> 00:09:37,980
Just an iced Americano is fine.

99
00:09:38,219 --> 00:09:40,219
Ms. Rungrada is here to see you.

100
00:09:42,060 --> 00:09:43,219
Thank you.

101
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:46,820
- Mr. Rapee.
- Hm.

102
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:50,020
Do you know about Kao yet?

103
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:54,139
And why exactly would I need to know, Ms. Rungrada?

104
00:09:54,140 --> 00:09:55,700
It’s none of my business

105
00:09:57,379 --> 00:10:01,780
Ryan told me
that Kao quit the school.

106
00:10:02,459 --> 00:10:04,619
If she quit, that’s her business. And

107
00:10:05,419 --> 00:10:07,660
why are you making excuses for her?

108
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:11,379
I can’t go back to living with
someone like that anymore. Do you understand?

109
00:10:12,660 --> 00:10:13,820
Come on.

110
00:10:14,379 --> 00:10:16,940
She just plays games. That’s all, isn’t it?

111
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:20,740
It’s not just that she plays.

112
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:24,020
She lied to me for so long
For months. Months.

113
00:10:24,179 --> 00:10:25,780
Lying, huh.

114
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:27,980
Look

115
00:10:28,219 --> 00:10:31,579
are you sure you’re mad at her
because she lied?

116
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:36,379
Or is it that you found out she plays games
and you’re scared of losing her the way you lost P’Phan?

117
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:44,700
Games aren’t as bad as we used to think, Pee.

118
00:10:49,619 --> 00:10:52,579
I know you’re still wounded over P’Phan.

119
00:10:53,339 --> 00:10:55,820
But Kao isn’t like P’Phan.

120
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:33,900
P’Kao.

121
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,179
Take your shoes off too.

122
00:11:44,740 --> 00:11:45,940
Hello, Bii?

123
00:11:46,339 --> 00:11:48,980
Is P’Kao gonna stay at our house forever?

124
00:11:49,379 --> 00:11:51,899
And now, back to our high-society headline.

125
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:53,739
The owner of the Double P Group hotels,

126
00:11:53,740 --> 00:11:56,700
Mr. Rapee, has been hinting lately that his resort

127
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:59,539
his new resort.

128
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:20,780
W-wait, wait, wait
P’Kao, what are you doing?

129
00:12:20,940 --> 00:12:21,980
Beating the batter.

130
00:12:22,259 --> 00:12:25,219
Stop, stop
Your wrist’s gonna hurt again.

131
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:29,539
I told you to stay still.

132
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:33,299
If your hand gets worse
you won’t be able to compete.

133
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:37,179
I’m not on the team anymore
There’s nothing left for me to compete in.

134
00:12:41,619 --> 00:12:42,900
P’Kao.

135
00:12:43,219 --> 00:12:44,980
Have you really thought this through?

136
00:12:45,339 --> 00:12:47,980
Wasn’t this your dream?

137
00:12:49,459 --> 00:12:52,419
Even though I like to complain
when you guys ask me to play games.

138
00:12:52,820 --> 00:12:54,379
I still know

139
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:57,740
that gaming is your life
and your happiness.

140
00:13:01,619 --> 00:13:03,459
You can’t live

141
00:13:04,020 --> 00:13:05,660
without happiness.

142
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:11,499
Thanks, Natty.

143
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:13,619
Come on, sis.

144
00:13:13,980 --> 00:13:16,579
If you’re born human,
you’ve gotta chase your dream.

145
00:13:17,219 --> 00:13:21,379
You only get one life
Don’t just waste it away.

146
00:13:22,419 --> 00:13:23,740
Are you singing at me right now?

147
00:13:23,900 --> 00:13:27,060
Oh, life has so much to it
Born, grow old, get sick, die, day after day.

148
00:13:27,579 --> 00:13:29,219
Go make TikToks, Natty.

149
00:13:31,499 --> 00:13:34,459
I’m trying to cheer you up
and you don’t even like it.

150
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,339
Aren’t you guys going to practice?

151
00:14:21,219 --> 00:14:25,219
What’s Team GP without you anyway?

152
00:14:26,379 --> 00:14:29,820
How can it still be GP
if there’s no Tep G?

153
00:14:31,072 --> 00:14:32,792
I really do appreciate you guys

154
00:14:33,379 --> 00:14:35,060
for caring

155
00:14:35,539 --> 00:14:37,219
and coming to see me today.

156
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:41,579
But are you guys insane?

157
00:14:42,219 --> 00:14:44,820
Do you know how hard it was just
to make it into the Pro League?

158
00:14:46,539 --> 00:14:48,619
Do you really want me
to hold you back that badly?

159
00:14:50,219 --> 00:14:51,219
Huh?

160
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,900
Go back and practice.

161
00:14:55,339 --> 00:14:57,940
And bring home the championship you want.

162
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:00,980
Don’t waste your time on me.

163
00:15:05,219 --> 00:15:06,219
Move.

164
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:10,100
- Move.
- No.

165
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:18,980
Huh?

166
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:21,419
Oh Kao.

167
00:15:23,740 --> 00:15:25,020
She left.

168
00:15:26,060 --> 00:15:27,539
Just let her go for now.

169
00:15:30,179 --> 00:15:33,100
Tomorrow, once we strip the frame
everything should be done.

170
00:15:33,539 --> 00:15:35,779
Thanks so much, bro
See you tomorrow then.

171
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:36,819
Sure.

172
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:38,459
- See you.
- See you.

173
00:15:55,100 --> 00:15:56,379
Hey, fire!

174
00:15:57,140 --> 00:15:59,860
Water! Get water!

175
00:16:00,259 --> 00:16:01,259
Hey, fire! Hey!

176
00:16:01,499 --> 00:16:03,140
Water! Water!

177
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,100
Fire!

178
00:16:05,259 --> 00:16:06,900
Water! Water!

179
00:16:08,459 --> 00:16:09,499
Get water.

180
00:16:10,379 --> 00:16:11,940
Bring water, bring water.

181
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:15,860
- Hurry.
- Call the fire department! Hurry!

182
00:16:34,499 --> 00:16:35,820
Handle it.

183
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,660
Move faster! Hurry up!

184
00:16:40,419 --> 00:16:42,419
Take care of it, now!

185
00:16:51,419 --> 00:16:54,100
Mr. Rapee, don’t go in there
It’s dangerous, Mr. Rapee

186
00:16:54,219 --> 00:16:56,660
Mr. Rapee,
let the workers handle this.

187
00:17:02,339 --> 00:17:06,299
If we didn’t have that hotel back then,
we wouldn’t have this family today.

188
00:17:07,740 --> 00:17:09,860
Let’s make new memories.

189
00:17:10,100 --> 00:17:11,499
Better ones.

190
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:14,980
With the hotel... and other things too.

191
00:17:22,219 --> 00:17:23,258
Burn it.

192
00:17:23,259 --> 00:17:24,700
Burn it all down.

193
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:28,218
Shit, you’re weak as hell.

194
00:17:28,219 --> 00:17:29,499
Move aside. Move aside.

195
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:31,100
I’ll handle this part myself.

196
00:17:31,379 --> 00:17:33,419
Hey, all of you get over here.

197
00:17:34,060 --> 00:17:35,139
Move, now.

198
00:17:35,140 --> 00:17:36,860
Why the hell are you so slow?

199
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,020
All of you

200
00:17:52,259 --> 00:17:53,339
listen to me.

201
00:17:53,539 --> 00:17:54,700
Next time

202
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:56,780
when I call the play

203
00:17:56,940 --> 00:17:58,499
do what I say.

204
00:17:58,700 --> 00:18:00,740
And when I tell you to move

205
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:03,298
move your asses faster.

206
00:18:03,299 --> 00:18:05,259
If you guys keep sucking like this

207
00:18:05,539 --> 00:18:07,299
and I have to carry all by myself

208
00:18:08,100 --> 00:18:09,980
you’ll never win

209
00:18:10,419 --> 00:18:12,860
we played like shit.

210
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:15,619
Or do you just wanna hog
the spotlight and screw the team?

211
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:18,499
This game is played as a team.

212
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,178
If you don’t want a team

213
00:18:20,179 --> 00:18:22,419
then maybe you shouldn’t have joined in the first place.

214
00:18:29,660 --> 00:18:31,100
Power-tripping asshole.

215
00:18:31,980 --> 00:18:34,980
It’s like the second
Professor Methat became captain

216
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:37,700
everything went to shit.

217
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:40,740
I miss Tep G.

218
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,020
Yeah.

219
00:18:43,419 --> 00:18:45,379
How do we get Tep G back?

220
00:18:47,219 --> 00:18:49,539
I think... I know.

221
00:19:08,619 --> 00:19:09,980
Hello.

222
00:19:57,100 --> 00:19:58,219
P’Pee.

223
00:20:03,419 --> 00:20:04,539
P’Pee.

224
00:20:13,539 --> 00:20:15,100
Please hear Kao out.

225
00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:18,379
Kao has something to say.

226
00:20:24,379 --> 00:20:25,940
- Does it hurt that bad?
- Hey.

227
00:20:32,259 --> 00:20:34,219
Kao knows you’re mad, P’Pee.

228
00:20:35,259 --> 00:20:37,339
But Kao wants to explain so you’ll understand.

229
00:20:38,619 --> 00:20:40,459
Everything Kao did.

230
00:20:41,379 --> 00:20:44,100
Kao only did it because Kao wanted to follow Kao’s dream.

231
00:20:51,219 --> 00:20:52,499
You want me to understand?

232
00:20:53,499 --> 00:20:54,940
You wanted to follow your dream?

233
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:57,299
You wanted to follow your dream?

234
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:59,820
See your dream?
It all went up in flames.

235
00:21:10,900 --> 00:21:13,219
And you expect me to believe your apology?

236
00:21:16,459 --> 00:21:18,020
From a liar like you?

237
00:21:19,179 --> 00:21:21,900
All you do is lie. Lie, lie, lie, lie, lie.

238
00:21:26,660 --> 00:21:28,579
I don’t want anything from you.

239
00:21:31,179 --> 00:21:34,418
Go earn back every baht you owe me.

240
00:21:34,419 --> 00:21:35,940
Can you do that?

241
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:40,579
Don’t apologize to me.

242
00:21:45,020 --> 00:21:46,780
And bring me the divorce papers signed.

243
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:50,140
Wait.

244
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:53,459
What now?

245
00:22:04,700 --> 00:22:06,020
Kao’s done.

246
00:23:18,140 --> 00:23:21,259
Found you at last, Thousand Thunder.

247
00:23:39,060 --> 00:23:41,060
What do I get if I let go? What do I get?

248
00:23:41,459 --> 00:23:42,579
I don’t know.

249
00:23:45,539 --> 00:23:46,539
Shit.

250
00:23:46,900 --> 00:23:49,179
There are only two left.

251
00:23:49,780 --> 00:23:51,339
Then the other one must be...

252
00:23:51,619 --> 00:23:54,619
I found you, Thousand Thunder.

253
00:23:54,900 --> 00:23:57,859
Shit, I’m just the support watching his back.

254
00:23:57,860 --> 00:24:00,418
How am I supposed to fight
if you throw me into the front line like this?

255
00:24:00,419 --> 00:24:02,579
We don’t even have a carry, asshole.

256
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:11,140
Thousand Thunder.

257
00:24:11,379 --> 00:24:12,060
Uh...

258
00:24:12,219 --> 00:24:14,299
Please don’t kill me yet.

259
00:24:14,459 --> 00:24:15,939
Wait, wait, wait please don’t shoot.

260
00:24:15,940 --> 00:24:19,940
My friend’s a gamer
because you’re his idol.

261
00:24:20,179 --> 00:24:22,378
But he’s about to give up on his dream.

262
00:24:22,379 --> 00:24:24,459
Could you... talk to my friend for me?

263
00:24:27,900 --> 00:24:29,140
Damn.

264
00:24:39,820 --> 00:24:41,940
Message from Thousand Thunder:
What did you just say?

265
00:24:43,579 --> 00:24:44,939
You took forever.

266
00:24:44,940 --> 00:24:46,379
I’m right here.

267
00:24:47,820 --> 00:24:48,900
Who is it?

268
00:24:49,379 --> 00:24:51,419
The person you’ve wanted to meet most in your life.

269
00:24:54,940 --> 00:24:56,619
Somsak Jeamteerasakul?

270
00:24:57,020 --> 00:24:58,700
Of course not.

271
00:24:59,660 --> 00:25:00,980
Thousand Thunder.

272
00:25:18,219 --> 00:25:19,980
Why are you crying, Kao?

273
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:23,418
Mom said Kao plays too many games.

274
00:25:23,419 --> 00:25:25,780
So she took them all away.

275
00:25:26,100 --> 00:25:27,980
Why do you even care?

276
00:25:28,179 --> 00:25:29,660
Just keep playing.

277
00:25:30,780 --> 00:25:32,060
Remember this

278
00:25:32,219 --> 00:25:34,579
you’re the best in my universe, Kao.

279
00:25:36,752 --> 00:25:38,020
P’Phankorn.

280
00:25:38,740 --> 00:25:39,740
Mm.

281
00:25:41,459 --> 00:25:42,980
Are you happy or sad?

282
00:25:44,299 --> 00:25:45,619
Happy, of course.

283
00:25:46,579 --> 00:25:48,100
It’s been so long.

284
00:25:48,660 --> 00:25:49,699
I never thought.

285
00:25:49,700 --> 00:25:51,900
I’d see Kao
as a pro player like this.

286
00:25:54,820 --> 00:25:56,740
Kao had you as an idol, P’Phan.

287
00:25:58,619 --> 00:25:59,619
P’Phan.

288
00:26:00,579 --> 00:26:02,099
Do you remember when we were kids?

289
00:26:02,100 --> 00:26:04,100
You gave Kao a Game Boy.

290
00:26:04,579 --> 00:26:05,780
And you said.

291
00:26:06,060 --> 00:26:09,700
Kao should do what Kao wanted

292
00:26:11,619 --> 00:26:13,139
and not care what anyone else thought.

293
00:26:13,459 --> 00:26:14,900
Kao still has that Game Boy.

294
00:26:16,419 --> 00:26:18,900
Do you mean Rapee?

295
00:26:20,140 --> 00:26:21,579
That Game Boy.

296
00:26:22,379 --> 00:26:23,660
I had on.

297
00:26:24,339 --> 00:26:25,780
Rapee had one too.

298
00:26:26,219 --> 00:26:28,780
But mine
is still back at the house.

299
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:39,700
Shit.

300
00:26:43,020 --> 00:26:44,900
Don’t overthink things with Pee.

301
00:26:45,140 --> 00:26:46,859
The reason he hates games.

302
00:26:46,860 --> 00:26:48,539
Because of me.

303
00:26:51,100 --> 00:26:53,179
I’m really sorry about your dad.

304
00:26:54,219 --> 00:26:58,740
The reason you haven’t gone back home...
it’s because of this, right?

305
00:27:03,419 --> 00:27:04,539
Mm...

306
00:27:05,619 --> 00:27:07,539
There’s something I want to ask you.

307
00:27:11,020 --> 00:27:12,900
Why do you play games?

308
00:27:17,459 --> 00:27:18,859
- Uh.
- You don’t have to answer me.

309
00:27:19,140 --> 00:27:20,660
Keep that answer for yourself.

310
00:27:21,579 --> 00:27:23,419
But I’ll tell you one thing.

311
00:27:26,459 --> 00:27:30,019
No one’s gonna accept you

312
00:27:30,020 --> 00:27:33,140
if you don’t even accept yourself first.

313
00:27:37,539 --> 00:27:39,379
You’re not alone, you know.

314
00:27:39,780 --> 00:27:41,259
You still have your team.

315
00:27:52,140 --> 00:27:53,178
Oh.

316
00:27:53,179 --> 00:27:54,700
You’re heading back already? Bye.

317
00:28:00,259 --> 00:28:01,740
Damn.

318
00:28:01,980 --> 00:28:03,339
Who was that?

319
00:28:03,820 --> 00:28:05,980
Why does he look so cool even carrying takeout?

320
00:28:27,100 --> 00:28:28,179
Kanya.

321
00:28:29,459 --> 00:28:31,900
You made a lot of mistakes today.

322
00:28:32,140 --> 00:28:34,099
If Methat hadn’t stepped in at the end,

323
00:28:34,100 --> 00:28:35,700
we would’ve lost that match.

324
00:28:37,860 --> 00:28:39,219
And where the hell is Phos?

325
00:28:40,339 --> 00:28:41,660
Why isn’t he back yet?

326
00:28:41,820 --> 00:28:44,100
Didn’t he just ask for an hour off?

327
00:28:59,100 --> 00:29:00,580
What business could he possibly have?

328
00:29:00,619 --> 00:29:02,060
People are trying to practice here.

329
00:29:02,940 --> 00:29:04,419
Outsiders shouldn’t be involved.

330
00:29:05,339 --> 00:29:06,779
Actually... I think we are involved.

331
00:29:07,740 --> 00:29:12,140
Me and everyone on Team GP

332
00:29:13,060 --> 00:29:15,100
we’re terminating our contract with Mamon.

333
00:29:15,259 --> 00:29:17,700
And we’re entering the Pro League
on our own.

334
00:29:18,780 --> 00:29:22,100
All the money I spent training you
how are you going to pay that back?

335
00:29:23,379 --> 00:29:24,579
Don’t worry.

336
00:29:25,299 --> 00:29:28,700
I’ll pay back every single baht.

337
00:29:29,700 --> 00:29:32,980
As for the slot fee,
we’ll handle that ourselves.

338
00:29:44,259 --> 00:29:45,579
Hey, hurry up.

339
00:29:45,740 --> 00:29:47,379
Shit, wait! Wait for me.

340
00:29:47,619 --> 00:29:48,619
Come on.

341
00:29:55,619 --> 00:29:57,900
What, you’re not coming, professor?

342
00:29:58,499 --> 00:30:00,140
Do I look like I wanna go?

343
00:30:01,219 --> 00:30:02,619
Alright then see you, professor.

344
00:30:02,940 --> 00:30:04,100
Hey, wait up.

345
00:30:06,100 --> 00:30:08,618
Damn, that was intense.
I thought it was gonna turn into a fight.

346
00:30:08,619 --> 00:30:09,979
This is unreal.
Our dream actually came true.

347
00:30:09,980 --> 00:30:11,259
That’s insane.

348
00:30:11,539 --> 00:30:14,100
So... the six million baht slot fee
you’ve got it ready, right?

349
00:30:16,780 --> 00:30:17,579
Nope.

350
00:30:17,580 --> 00:30:18,860
- Wait, what?
- What?

351
00:30:21,140 --> 00:30:22,140
Well

352
00:30:22,459 --> 00:30:23,700
we’ll figure something out.

353
00:30:25,499 --> 00:30:26,660
Wait.

354
00:30:36,060 --> 00:30:38,140
You see that dream?
It’s all burned to ashes.

355
00:30:41,179 --> 00:30:42,899
And bring me the signed divorce papers too.

356
00:30:45,419 --> 00:30:46,539
Kao already signed them.

357
00:31:00,619 --> 00:31:01,619
Hey.

358
00:31:03,100 --> 00:31:03,860
Hey.

359
00:31:03,861 --> 00:31:05,619
What? Why are you so shocked?

360
00:31:05,780 --> 00:31:06,539
Pee.

361
00:31:06,700 --> 00:31:07,700
Pee.

362
00:31:07,980 --> 00:31:08,980
Hey, Pee.

363
00:31:09,619 --> 00:31:10,820
It’s me.

364
00:31:11,219 --> 00:31:12,539
Somsakjeam.

365
00:31:14,140 --> 00:31:16,419
Just kidding, asshole.
It’s your brother.

366
00:31:16,619 --> 00:31:17,780
Phankorn.

367
00:31:24,780 --> 00:31:26,619
I saw the news about the resort.

368
00:31:27,219 --> 00:31:28,379
You okay?

369
00:31:30,459 --> 00:31:31,459
And Mom

370
00:31:31,619 --> 00:31:32,740
how is she?

371
00:31:33,379 --> 00:31:34,940
If you miss her

372
00:31:36,140 --> 00:31:37,820
go see her yourself.

373
00:31:46,219 --> 00:31:47,499
I’m sorry

374
00:31:49,060 --> 00:31:50,820
for leaving you like that.

375
00:31:51,740 --> 00:31:53,339
I know I was selfish

376
00:31:53,619 --> 00:31:55,458
I wanted to come back to you too.

377
00:31:55,459 --> 00:31:57,259
If you’re done talking.

378
00:31:58,459 --> 00:31:59,499
I’m leaving.

379
00:32:02,980 --> 00:32:04,339
I already went to see Kao.

380
00:32:12,740 --> 00:32:14,579
Kao gave up her dream

381
00:32:14,740 --> 00:32:16,140
for you.

382
00:32:17,219 --> 00:32:18,860
You know that, don’t you?

383
00:32:19,379 --> 00:32:21,459
Someone who gives up their dream like that

384
00:32:22,780 --> 00:32:24,140
you know how it feels, right?

385
00:32:33,020 --> 00:32:35,700
Remember when you were kids?
When you used to play games with Kao?

386
00:32:47,820 --> 00:32:49,700
In case you wanna see her.

387
00:33:08,900 --> 00:33:10,780
Your mom misses you a lot.

388
00:33:32,259 --> 00:33:35,179
(ID: Gunslinger God)

389
00:33:49,140 --> 00:33:52,579
Hello Nice outfit.

390
00:33:53,020 --> 00:33:55,219
Oh thanks.

391
00:33:56,259 --> 00:33:57,860
If you want free items,

392
00:33:58,020 --> 00:33:59,859
I’ll drop them in front of your house.

393
00:33:59,860 --> 00:34:01,140
Just pick them up.

394
00:34:03,259 --> 00:34:04,780
Are you okay?

395
00:34:04,940 --> 00:34:06,419
Why are you sitting here?

396
00:34:07,539 --> 00:34:09,700
This world...
it’s quieter than the real one

397
00:34:09,940 --> 00:34:12,179
I just wanted to sit and think for a bit.

398
00:34:13,539 --> 00:34:15,619
You can talk to me, you know.

399
00:34:26,020 --> 00:34:27,459
Honestly...

400
00:34:27,860 --> 00:34:30,579
t’s just that
no matter what I do,

401
00:34:30,740 --> 00:34:33,100
I always mess it up.

402
00:34:37,179 --> 00:34:40,740
Even when the opportunity
is right in front of me. I still screw it up.

403
00:34:41,900 --> 00:34:45,259
Maybe...
I deserve this.

404
00:34:54,100 --> 00:34:56,020
Why would you say that?

405
00:34:57,539 --> 00:34:59,820
Because I haven’t been honest with myself.

406
00:35:00,419 --> 00:35:02,700
And I’ve hurt the people around me.

407
00:35:03,700 --> 00:35:05,580
Especially one person who really matters to me.

408
00:35:08,579 --> 00:35:10,579
If you did something wrong and never fixed it

409
00:35:11,539 --> 00:35:13,060
then go talk to him.

410
00:35:14,339 --> 00:35:15,339
Forget it.

411
00:35:16,060 --> 00:35:18,539
There’s no way I could ever face him
and apologize now.

412
00:35:18,820 --> 00:35:21,299
Maybe it’s better
if it just hurts and ends here.

413
00:35:21,539 --> 00:35:23,219
That’d probably be better for everyone.

414
00:35:25,379 --> 00:35:27,140
Is there anything I can do to help?

415
00:35:30,780 --> 00:35:31,780
Really?

416
00:35:32,459 --> 00:35:34,700
Then can you lend me six million baht?

417
00:35:56,820 --> 00:35:58,299
When you have a dream

418
00:35:59,140 --> 00:36:00,498
you’ve gotta go after it.

419
00:36:00,499 --> 00:36:01,618
You can’t just think about it.

420
00:36:01,619 --> 00:36:03,860
You get it, right?
You’ve gotta actually do something.

421
00:36:17,780 --> 00:36:19,020
Just a moment, please.

422
00:36:19,619 --> 00:36:21,419
Could you hurry a little, please?

423
00:36:21,579 --> 00:36:22,660
Yes.

424
00:36:23,299 --> 00:36:25,419
Are you seriously doing this?
Selling the condo?

425
00:36:25,579 --> 00:36:27,259
There’s no turning back now.

426
00:36:39,740 --> 00:36:41,299
Shit.

427
00:36:45,299 --> 00:36:46,499
I’m sorry.

428
00:36:47,459 --> 00:36:48,579
I’m not selling it anymore.

429
00:36:50,820 --> 00:36:52,860
Sorry for wasting your time.

430
00:36:54,379 --> 00:36:56,258
I’m really sorry.
I’m sorry.

431
00:36:56,259 --> 00:36:59,020
Could you please head back first?

432
00:36:59,339 --> 00:37:00,498
I’m sorry.

433
00:37:00,499 --> 00:37:01,859
What a waste of time.

434
00:37:01,860 --> 00:37:03,939
- Sorry.
- Sorry.

435
00:37:03,940 --> 00:37:05,179
Sorry.

436
00:37:06,459 --> 00:37:08,339
Get home safe.

437
00:37:22,379 --> 00:37:23,739
I’m sorry, guys.

438
00:37:23,740 --> 00:37:25,299
Hey, it’s okay.

439
00:37:25,499 --> 00:37:26,780
Don’t beat yourself up over it.

440
00:37:27,060 --> 00:37:28,419
You did the right thing.

441
00:37:28,820 --> 00:37:30,020
Seriously.

442
00:37:31,419 --> 00:37:34,179
We can just try again later, right?

443
00:37:36,579 --> 00:37:39,100
Oh, shit.

444
00:37:44,020 --> 00:37:45,539
Looks like Team GP

445
00:37:46,660 --> 00:37:49,299
can only make it this far.

446
00:37:51,259 --> 00:37:52,299
Who says?

447
00:38:12,339 --> 00:38:13,740
Remember this.

448
00:38:14,219 --> 00:38:15,980
In my universe.

449
00:38:17,419 --> 00:38:19,060
Kao is the best.

450
00:38:45,020 --> 00:38:46,979
Are you feeling okay, P’Pee?

451
00:38:46,980 --> 00:38:49,780
You know what Kao’s team is, right?

452
00:38:55,100 --> 00:38:57,459
Team GP is the rookie gamer team

453
00:38:57,700 --> 00:38:59,940
with the oldest average age in the league, right?

454
00:39:00,179 --> 00:39:01,419
- Damn.
- Damn.

455
00:39:01,619 --> 00:39:02,859
Wow, way to make us sound old

456
00:39:02,860 --> 00:39:05,540
I already told my secretary
to transfer the slot fee for all of you.

457
00:39:08,499 --> 00:39:10,499
- Holy shit.
- Seven million?

458
00:39:10,780 --> 00:39:12,699
- Shit.
- That’s a ton of money.

459
00:39:12,700 --> 00:39:14,619
Is this some kind of Christmas gift?

460
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:17,379
Oh, thank you, Buddha, Dhamma, and Sangha.

461
00:39:17,539 --> 00:39:19,140
What does that mean?

462
00:39:19,339 --> 00:39:20,179
Pro League.

463
00:39:20,180 --> 00:39:22,780
Shit, we’re really getting to play
in the Pro League, sis.

464
00:39:23,020 --> 00:39:25,780
Thank you, boss.

465
00:39:26,860 --> 00:39:28,859
Why the hell is Kao’s husband
being so nice all of a sudden?

466
00:39:28,860 --> 00:39:30,659
- Yeah.
- I think he got laid.

467
00:39:30,660 --> 00:39:32,299
Go back to playing with your worm, dude.

468
00:39:32,579 --> 00:39:34,020
Thank you so much, P’Pee

469
00:39:34,179 --> 00:39:36,259
I promise I’ll pay you back.

470
00:39:37,459 --> 00:39:38,780
You don’t have to, Kao.

471
00:39:39,660 --> 00:39:41,379
I didn’t invest in this team

472
00:39:42,140 --> 00:39:43,499
because of you.

473
00:39:43,940 --> 00:39:47,299
It’s because I see
real potential in this team as an investment.

474
00:39:47,459 --> 00:39:50,780
But I’m not exactly an expert
in this industry

475
00:39:51,140 --> 00:39:52,339
so...

476
00:39:53,539 --> 00:39:55,140
I brought in some backup.

477
00:40:00,820 --> 00:40:02,060
Hello, everyone.

478
00:40:08,060 --> 00:40:11,259
Let me introduce P’Phankorn.

479
00:40:11,619 --> 00:40:12,940
P’Phan.

480
00:40:14,219 --> 00:40:15,418
Who the hell is this, sis?

481
00:40:15,419 --> 00:40:16,379
TT

482
00:40:16,380 --> 00:40:17,579
No way.

483
00:40:18,700 --> 00:40:19,820
You two.

484
00:40:21,379 --> 00:40:22,739
Are you guys okay now?

485
00:40:22,740 --> 00:40:24,339
We can talk about that later.

486
00:40:24,539 --> 00:40:25,539
Go on, Pee.

487
00:40:26,020 --> 00:40:27,020
Alright.

488
00:40:27,100 --> 00:40:31,700
As the main investor of Team GP.

489
00:40:31,900 --> 00:40:33,700
I’m appointing P’Phan

490
00:40:33,860 --> 00:40:38,140
as Team GP’s coach and manager
starting now.

491
00:40:39,140 --> 00:40:41,100
Holy shit. Chills.

492
00:40:54,259 --> 00:40:56,060
Any objections?

493
00:40:57,660 --> 00:40:59,140
That was so Thanos.

494
00:40:59,299 --> 00:41:00,339
Seriously.

495
00:41:09,299 --> 00:41:10,379
Um.

496
00:41:11,860 --> 00:41:13,419
I just...

497
00:41:30,020 --> 00:41:32,259
- P’Pee...
- I’m sorry, Kao.

498
00:41:34,579 --> 00:41:36,100
I’m sorry.

499
00:41:38,499 --> 00:41:42,259
I’m sorry for pulling you
into my dream without ever asking what you wanted.

500
00:41:46,780 --> 00:41:48,298
It’s not that bad.

501
00:41:48,299 --> 00:41:50,539
From now on,
whatever you want to do

502
00:41:50,900 --> 00:41:52,419
just do it.

503
00:41:55,100 --> 00:41:56,619
I understand everything now.

504
00:41:59,259 --> 00:42:00,820
Thank you, Kao.

505
00:42:03,619 --> 00:42:04,820
P’Pee.

506
00:42:11,579 --> 00:42:13,379
Thank you too.

507
00:42:34,820 --> 00:42:37,820
A rom-com is supposed to end
with a happy ending, isn’t it?

508
00:42:46,539 --> 00:42:49,179
Our goal is to win the Pro League.

509
00:43:06,740 --> 00:43:07,940
Nat.

510
00:43:08,660 --> 00:43:11,100
Take this

511
00:43:12,339 --> 00:43:13,539
Pete, move.

512
00:43:23,619 --> 00:43:25,780
— Damn, Solo Tap — Solo Tap!

513
00:43:26,020 --> 00:43:27,458
Peaceful Peaceful.

514
00:43:27,459 --> 00:43:29,819
Top lane is mine.

515
00:43:29,820 --> 00:43:31,700
What? Top lane, my ass.

516
00:43:35,820 --> 00:43:38,259
So? Pro League, right?

517
00:43:38,419 --> 00:43:39,700
Hey.

518
00:43:39,860 --> 00:43:41,555
Who the hell hired you
to come out here like this?

519
00:43:41,579 --> 00:43:43,219
I think it looks good.
Fits perfectly
